---
title: "pi-workstream: plan, execute, review, repeat"
---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: pi-workstream flow
    accDescr: Record a planning checkpoint, bind a plan, and fork at the checkpoint. Execute only the current H2 batch. Review its summary, revalidate the plan and session, compress the execution, and complete the batch. Repeat for the next batch.

    %% Source: src/workstream.ts, src/plan.ts, src/session.ts, src/ui.ts.
    %% Connect whole sections to keep their local top-to-bottom direction.

    subgraph PLAN["1. PLAN AND FORK"]
        direction TB
        P0(["Read source context<br/>Then stop before planning"])
        P1["/workstream plan<br/>Save the settled checkpoint"]:::command
        P2["PLANNING<br/>Write and refine the canonical plan<br/>First successful write binds planId"]
        P3["/workstream run<br/>Approve the current batch snapshot<br/>Fork at the checkpoint"]:::command
        P4["Keep the source session unchanged<br/>The fork keeps source context<br/>but excludes later planning"]:::success
        PN["Reject invalid writes or approvals<br/>A cancelled fork stays in PLANNING"]:::note
        PR["Reload / restart:<br/>Restore the bound plan and saved state<br/>Never select another plan as a fallback"]:::note

        P0 --> P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4
        P2 -.- PN
        P1 -.- PR
    end

    subgraph EXEC["2. EXECUTE AND REVIEW"]
        direction TB
        E0["STARTING<br/>Revalidate approval in the fork<br/>Send nothing if it changed"]
        E1["RUNNING<br/>Save state and batch-start marker<br/>Send preamble + current H2 only"]
        E2["Execute the current batch<br/>Block direct plan write / edit"]
        E3["agent_settled starts COMPRESSING<br/>Save range + bitmap + operation ID<br/>Draft the batch summary"]
        E4{"Save a non-empty<br/>reviewed summary?"}:::decision
        EC["Keep the batch unchecked<br/>Steer or /workstream run to retry"]:::failure
        E5["Summary approved"]:::success

        E0 -->|Valid approval| E1 --> E2 --> E3 --> E4
        E4 -->|Cancel or empty| EC
        EC -. Retry .-> E3
        E4 -->|Save| E5
    end

    subgraph FINISH["3. VALIDATE AND COMPLETE"]
        direction TB
        V0{"Fresh plan snapshot and<br/>session range still match?"}:::decision
        VF["PAUSED<br/>Do not send a later batch<br/>Resolve the cause; run again"]:::failure
        V1["Apply compression<br/>Keep exact batch + approved summary<br/>Preserve original session entries"]
        V2["Atomically check the whole batch<br/>Verify the saved plan"]
        V3{"Another incomplete<br/>H2 batch remains?"}:::decision
        VN(["Return to RUNNING<br/>Send only the next H2"]):::success
        VD(["COMPLETE<br/>Keep planId + runId"]):::success
        VR["Resume after restart:<br/>Finish an applied compression,<br/>or resume the saved batch<br/>Do not fork or send a batch twice"]:::note

        V0 -->|No| VF
        V0 -->|Yes| V1 --> V2 --> V3
        V1 -. Mutation error .-> VF
        V2 -. Completion error .-> VF
        V3 -->|Yes| VN
        V3 -->|No| VD
        V2 -.- VR
    end

    PLAN -->|Valid native fork| EXEC
    EXEC -->|Saved summary| FINISH
